    # --- Eye Diseases ---
    {
        "name": "Conjunctivitis",
        "name_ja": "結膜炎",
        "symptoms": {"conjunctivitis", "eye_swelling", "eye_discharge", "head_shaking"},
        "description": "Conjunctivitis is an ophthalmic condition affecting the eye or surrounding structures.",
        "description_ja": "感染、刺激、ビタミンA欠乏による結膜の炎症。",
        "urgency": "moderate",
        "recommended_tests": ["ocular examination", "culture and sensitivity"],
        "causes": "Ocular disease from infectious agents, trauma, congenital defects, immune-mediated processes, degenerative changes, or systemic disease affecting the eye. Environmental factors (dust, UV) contribute.",
        "causes_ja": "インコにおける結膜炎の原因: 感染性病原体、外傷、先天性欠損、免疫介在性過程、変性変化、眼に影響する全身疾患による眼科疾患。環境因子（粉塵、UV）が寄与する。",
        "pathophysiology": "Conjunctivitis is an ophthalmic condition. Conjunctivitis The ocular pathology involves inflammatory, degenerative, or structural changes affecting the globe, adnexa, or visual pathways. Intraocular inflammation disrupts the blood-aqueous or blood-retinal barriers, leading to protein leakage, cellular infiltration, and potential vision loss. Elevated intraocular pressure damages the optic nerve and retinal ganglion cells. Corneal ulceration may progress to descemetocele or perforation.",
        "pathophysiology_ja": "結膜炎はインコにおける眼科疾患である。眼球、付属器、または視覚経路に影響を及ぼす炎症性、変性、または構造的変化を伴う。眼内炎症は血液房水関門・血液網膜関門を破壊し、蛋白漏出、細胞浸潤、視力喪失の可能性がある。眼圧上昇は視神経と網膜神経節細胞を損傷する。角膜潰瘍はデスメ膜瘤や穿孔に進行しうる。",
        "treatment": "Conjunctivitis in budgerigars — inflammation of the conjunctival membranes from infectious, environmental, or nutritional causes. DIAGNOSTIC WORKUP: Conjunctival swab for Gram stain and culture/sensitivity. Chlamydia psittaci PCR (important differential — causes unilateral/bilateral conjunctivitis with serous-to-mucopurulent discharge). Mycoplasma PCR. Cytology (heterophils = bacterial; lymphocytes/macrophages = chlamydial or viral; eosinophils = allergic). TOPICAL OPHTHALMIC THERAPY: Ciprofloxacin 0.3% ophthalmic drops 1 drop per eye q6-8h × 7-14 days (broad-spectrum first-line). Alternative: ofloxacin 0.3% drops q8h, or gentamicin 0.3% drops q6-8h. Tobramycin 0.3% drops q6-8h for Pseudomonas suspected. AVOID topical corticosteroids until corneal ulceration is ruled out (fluorescein stain). For non-infected inflammatory conjunctivitis: diclofenac 0.1% ophthalmic drops q8-12h (NSAID). CHLAMYDIAL CONJUNCTIVITIS: Systemic doxycycline 25-50 mg/kg PO q24h × 45 days (topical alone insufficient — Chlamydia is intracellular). VITAMIN A DEFICIENCY (common underlying cause in seed-fed budgerigars): Squamous metaplasia of conjunctival epithelium predisposes to secondary infections. Vitamin A supplementation: beta-carotene-rich foods (carrots, sweet potato, dark leafy greens) or injectable vitamin A 5,000-10,000 IU/kg IM once (CAUTION — vitamin A toxicity at high doses). Convert to pellet diet for balanced nutrition. ENVIRONMENTAL: Remove dusty substrates (corncob bedding, cedar shavings — irritants). Ensure adequate ventilation. Remove aerosol sprays, scented candles, air fresheners near cage. SUPPORTIVE: Warm saline eye lavage before applying drops to remove discharge. Meloxicam 0.5 mg/kg PO q24h if painful. MONITORING: Recheck in 7 days — improvement expected within 3-5 days for bacterial conjunctivitis. Persistent cases: re-culture, rule out chlamydiosis, assess for vitamin A status. Reference: Williams DL (2012) Ophthalmology of Exotic Pets; Kern TJ (1997) Vet Clin North Am Exot Anim Pract.",
        "treatment_ja": "セキセイインコの結膜炎 — 感染性、環境性、栄養性原因による結膜の炎症。【診断ワークアップ】: 結膜スワブのグラム染色・培養感受性。クラミジアPCR（重要な鑑別 — 漿液性〜粘液膿性の片側/両側結膜炎を引き起こす）。マイコプラズマPCR。細胞診（ヘテロフィル=細菌、リンパ球/マクロファージ=クラミジアまたはウイルス、好酸球=アレルギー）。【局所眼科療法】: シプロフロキサシン0.3%点眼液1滴/眼 q6-8h×7-14日間（広域第一選択）。代替: オフロキサシン0.3% q8h、またはゲンタマイシン0.3% q6-8h。緑膿菌疑いにトブラマイシン0.3% q6-8h。角膜潰瘍が除外されるまで局所コルチコステロイドは回避（フルオレセイン染色）。非感染性炎症性結膜炎: ジクロフェナク0.1%点眼q8-12h（NSAID）。【クラミジア結膜炎】: ドキシサイクリン25-50 mg/kg PO q24h×45日間の全身投与（局所のみでは不十分 — クラミジアは細胞内寄生）。【ビタミンA欠乏（シード食セキセイインコで多い基礎原因）】: 結膜上皮の扁平上皮化生が二次感染の素因に。ビタミンA補充: βカロテン豊富食品（ニンジン、サツマイモ、濃緑葉野菜）または注射ビタミンA 5,000-10,000 IU/kg IM 1回（注意 — 高用量でビタミンA毒性）。ペレット食に転換。【環境】: 粉塵の多い床材（コーンコブ、スギチップ — 刺激物）を除去。十分な換気。ケージ近くのエアゾールスプレー、アロマキャンドル、芳香剤を除去。【支持療法】: 点眼前に温生食で眼を洗浄し分泌物を除去。疼痛時メロキシカム0.5 mg/kg PO q24h。【モニタリング】: 7日で再検 — 細菌性結膜炎は3-5日以内に改善が期待される。遷延例: 再培養、クラミジア除外、ビタミンA状態評価。参考: Williams DL (2012) Ophthalmology of Exotic Pets; Kern TJ (1997).",
        "prevention": "Prevention of conjunctivitis includes appropriate husbandry, balanced species-specific nutrition, regular veterinary health checks, stress minimization, maintaining clean living conditions, and prompt attention to early clinical signs.",
        "prevention_ja": "結膜炎の予防: 定期眼科検査。",
        "prognosis": "Generally good to fair with appropriate treatment and follow-up care. Prognosis improves with early diagnosis and owner compliance.",
        "prognosis_ja": "結膜炎の予後: 早期治療で視機能温存可能。",
        "onset_pattern": {"acute", "subacute"},
        "age_predisposition": {"adult", "young", "senior"},
    },
